# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lab App — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (or .env) and fill in the values below.
# Variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ are bundled into the client app and
# readable by anyone who has the app. Never put API keys here — all AI calls
# go through the backend.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Backend API ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL for the Lab App backend (including /api suffix). The WebSocket URL
# is derived from it. Defaults to the ngrok tunnel in env.ts.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com/api
